{
  "id": 5007189278852,
  "title": "Tatva Natural Latex and Coir Mattress",
  "handle": "tatva-natural-latex-and-coir-mattress",
  "description": "<style type=\"text/css\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<p><span data-sheets-value='{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"Tatva is crafted using the goodness of two natural materials, natural latex and coir, to provide a sleep experience that is truly transcendent. The biodegradable latex layer which is naturally resilient and supportive forms the core of this mattress. This is further enhanced by the natural goodness and firm support for the high density coir layer. The special pin cores on the latex layer allow for air circulation keeping the mattress fresh and hygienic.Tatva comes with a rich fabric infused with organic cotton for a cool and soft finish.\"}' data-sheets-userformat='{\"2\":14403,\"3\":{\"1\":0,\"3\":1},\"4\":{\"1\":2,\"2\":14001853},\"9\":1,\"14\":{\"1\":3,\"3\":1},\"15\":\"Calibri\",\"16\":11}' data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Tatva is crafted using the goodness of two natural materials, natural latex and coir, to provide a sleep experience that is truly transcendent. The biodegradable latex layer which is naturally resilient and supportive forms the core of this mattress. This is further enhanced by the natural goodness and firm support for the high density coir layer. The special pin cores on the latex layer allow for air circulation keeping the mattress fresh and hygienic. Tatva comes with a rich fabric infused with organic cotton for a cool and soft finish.</span></p>",
  "published_at": "2024-05-22T18:39:08+05:30",
